    a: [['Namuna', 'My teacher has great ability and a lot of kindness. Her lessons are useful and enjoyable. It is impossible to be bored. Our friendship is strong, and her leadership helped our development. She speaks clearly and works carefully. Without her, learning would be hopeless.']],
