  gi: 'Ingliz tilida ba’zi so‘zlar bir-biri bilan doim birga keladi — bu <b>collocation</b>. Ayniqsa, <b>make / do / have / take / get</b> bilan: <b>make</b> a mistake (✗ do a mistake), <b>do</b> homework (✗ make homework). Ularni yodlash — tabiiy gapirishning kaliti.',
