      x: '<p><b class="rd">make</b> — biror narsani <b>yaratish</b> yoki natija: make a <b>cake</b>, make a <b>decision</b>, make a <b>mistake</b>, make <b>money</b>, make a <b>noise</b>, make a <b>plan</b>, make <b>friends</b>, make an <b>effort</b>, make a <b>wish</b>.</p><p><b class="rd">do</b> — <b>ish, vazifa, faoliyat</b>: do <b>homework</b>, do the <b>dishes</b>, do the <b>shopping</b>, do <b>exercise</b>, do your <b>best</b>, do a <b>favour</b>, do <b>business</b>, do the <b>cooking</b>.</p><p><b class="rd">Esda tuting:</b> make a mistake / decision / progress; <b>do</b> homework / housework / your best.</p>',
      key: ['*make* a mistake / decision / cake / plan / friends / wish', '*do* homework / the dishes / your best / a favour / the shopping'],
