      x: '<p><b class="rd">get</b> — uch asosiy ma’no: <b>1) olmoq:</b> get a <b>job</b>, get a <b>gift</b>, get a <b>letter</b>, get <b>permission</b>. <b>2) bo‘lmoq:</b> get <b>tired</b>, get <b>angry</b>, get <b>married</b>, get <b>lost</b>, get <b>ready</b>, get <b>dressed</b>. <b>3) yetib bormoq:</b> get <b>home</b>, get <b>to</b> the party, get <b>there</b>.</p><p>Foydali: get <b>better</b> (yaxshilanmoq), get <b>worse</b>, get <b>together</b> (yig‘ilmoq), get <b>the idea</b> (tushunmoq), get <b>in touch</b> (bog‘lanmoq).</p><p><b class="rd">Esda tuting:</b> get married <b>to</b> + shaxs (✗ with): «She got married <b>to</b> Alisher.»</p>',
